# Vitest run artifacts. Nothing writes here with the current config — the reporters that would
# (json, junit, html, blob) are not switched on. Listed from vitest 5 onwards because that release
# moved all of them under one directory, so the day somebody turns a reporter on to chase a flaky
# test, the output does not turn up as untracked files in the next commit.
.vitest
